@*
    Lucide glyphs as inline SVG, the icon set the Frontend uses. Path data is copied from the
    @@lucide/svelte package: the icon packages ship a component per glyph, which is a lot of surface
    for the handful this UI uses, and inlining keeps them themeable through currentColor.

    Sized with Tailwind classes rather than a width/height attribute so callers can say bb:size-4.
*@

<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
     stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="@Class"
     aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    @((MarkupString)Path(Name))
</svg>

